these to run in real time,

00:28:12.360 --> 00:28:13.950
so you can preempt
me at any time

00:28:13.950 --> 00:28:16.533
and run other applications, as
long as this runs at some time.

00:28:16.533 --> 00:28:17.908
And so those are
great for, like,

00:28:17.908 --> 00:28:19.940
batch rendering or
simulations that don't

00:28:19.940 --> 00:28:21.360
need to be done in real time.

